						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13423#msg13423"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13423#msg13423">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> December 28, 2004, 07:16:51 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think you&#039;re exactly right, Self Destruction.&nbsp; There are plenty of players wanting to raid, some guilds will simply have to bite the bullet and either ally or allow themselves to be enveloped.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
