							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							EQ isn&#039;t over, I still play and I personally think I am one of maybe the 10-15 people on this board that still do.&nbsp; Yes, alot of guilds fell through and what Kinladar said pretty much sumarizes the situation.<br /><br /><br />----------------<br /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> EQ didn&#039;t end dude!&nbsp; That is just being mean.<br /><br />Why don&#039;t you go away and fuck your momma. <br /><br /><br />YOU ARE OWNED!!!!&nbsp; LOLOLOLOL </div><br />/claps at your ability to use the oldest insult in the history of the world and then laugh your butt off at somethin that isn&#039;t funny.
						</td>
