	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13432"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236" title="View the profile of Gonaiel">Gonaiel</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 94<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13432#msg13432"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13432#msg13432">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #22 on:</b> December 28, 2004, 11:09:35 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							What people fail to think about is SOE befor wow came out didnt give 2 shits about the player fan base and they knew was they were making money.&nbsp; Wow was just about ready to star4t there fianl push they had a second coming if you will...ie the summit.&nbsp; The people said f you soe and left for WOW and yes it is a better game though i cant play at the moment but my baby girl is fun to hang out with ya ya ya real llife sucks.&nbsp; You can see that with a few High End guild folding and alot more is real real bad shape.&nbsp; I think Ascent can aggree there.&nbsp; People got sick of soe crap and know they are paying the piper with the fialing of EQ2 and EQ 1 on its way ( EQ2 is running but from what i hear its a total let down and wow is rocking the world )&nbsp; &nbsp;CoH is a fun game for all of 20 lvls then its the same thing boring and you cant get anything but augments.&nbsp; When I first started playing it was awsome but later on all you do is spend 8 hours grinding out lvls doing the same thing over and over again thats not to bad but its the whole getting screwed with so to speak by soe.&nbsp; This is the End result of SOE listening to the dollar and not where that dollar came from.&nbsp; SoE has slit its own throat.&nbsp; They never though that people would leave for wow and now that it has happened its to late.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13433"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=872" title="View the profile of Dunkirk">Dunkirk</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 11<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=872"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:gillan_51@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13433#msg13433"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13433#msg13433">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> December 28, 2004, 11:43:13 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hard to say that eq2 already failed when it hasnt even been out for two months yet.&nbsp; There are like 20k on the populated servers, its safe to say theres a player base.&nbsp; The high end content will be the deciding factor for eq2, on my server (Najena) Vox has not been dropped yet, and nobody even has access to lavastorm.&nbsp; Vox has been dropped on one server (Mistmoore).&nbsp; If Soe pulls an EQoA where they provide &quot;casual&quot; end game then EQ2 will fail miserably, but if they provide an end game like that of eql then it will last for years.&nbsp; <br /><br />Looking at EQ2&#039;s opponent, WOW looks like a solid game, but the fact that some people reached lvl 60 in 11 days, and high end guilds already have a full raiding force they should plow right threw the content, Blizzard will not have the time to make an expansion fast enough and they could lose a vast majority of there player base.&nbsp; If this proves to be true then EQ2 will see a huge influx of players and competition.&nbsp; <br /><br />All in all it should be interesting, and by no means is EQ2 already a failing game.&nbsp; My opinion is that SOE has produced a game with the best end game raiding system out of any MMO, and blizzard has not even touched end game MMO&#039;s, all companies are power hungry.&nbsp; GO GO EQ2!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
