							Becuse Blizzard doesn&#039;t f- over its players like soe does. only when Wow was getting ready to make it push to finsh did soe suddenly have a heart and &quot;listen&quot; to its players only to break out 2 more expanstions in less then what 3 months time if that and it was never finshed.&nbsp; People gt sick of being messed with.&nbsp; Thats why WoW will thrive and eq will fall.
