							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I guess I just don&#039;t understand how EQ2 and WoW are all that different</div><br />You pretty much said it yourself..&nbsp; Give both games a try and you&#039;ll quicky see why WoW is such a success.<br /><br />cheers&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br /><br /><br />
